#: ../../source/imagemin-optipng_readme.md:40
msgid ""
"The optimization level 0 enables a set of optimization operations that "
"require minimal effort. There will be no changes to image attributes like"
" bit depth or color type, and no recompression of existing IDAT "
"datastreams. The optimization level 1 enables a single IDAT compression "
"trial. The trial chosen is what. OptiPNG thinks it’s probably the most "
"effective. The optimization levels 2 and higher enable multiple IDAT "
"compression trials; the higher the level, the more trials."
msgstr ""

